WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.272
I'm Sam the Checker.

00:00:02.422 --> 00:00:04.798
I review each piece of your plugin.

00:00:04.948 --> 00:00:07.276
You see how it looks in the Store.

00:00:07.426 --> 00:00:12.034
I ask, ready to publish? Nothing goes live until you say yes.

00:00:12.184 --> 00:00:14.416
Say yes, and it's published.

